        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"121c3815-cc1d-46cc-9840-4aab90e2a235\",\"review_text\":\"good for fresness.\"},{\"review_id\":\"92cc00fc-7089-4265-9ea1-d778cbdbe9d2\",\"review_text\":\"Amazing 👏 absolutely can't live without my Spotify finally a site/app that works better and less data streaming use then YouTube 👏 stay bliss yall 💕 much love Lil Savage69\"},{\"review_id\":\"d399c142-4662-4449-bcf2-dc7c7777d56a\",\"review_text\":\"Nice 👍\"},{\"review_id\":\"28f45a66-8b5a-42a8-9a3a-11d6d07ccd52\",\"review_text\":\"The shuffle and finding of good new music is not very reliable\"},{\"review_id\":\"9f023928-03bb-4c89-8d85-0e6270870ece\",\"review_text\":\"This app is great. The only problem that I have with it is that it is really laggy. Some of my songs won't play will use my skips. Also, I'll use one skip and the app won't let me use any more of my skips. This was all a while ago but I thought I should let you guys know. I have premuin now and it works great.\"},{\"review_id\":\"613715a3-c3b5-463a-9b05-68c70e12cf67\",\"review_text\":\"I hit this app and this country\"},{\"review_id\":\"2a20fb77-83a7-44f3-84a9-c036c175a190\",\"review_text\":\"Add an option to remove smart shuffle other than that 5 stars great app, happily been using premium since I got my first job 2 years ago\"},{\"review_id\":\"8df57b0e-e8c8-4e4b-bd48-a1fdfb9778f0\",\"review_text\":\"Osm\"},{\"review_id\":\"3df6a7ae-7755-41c1-b576-fc3d3b16ef05\",\"review_text\":\"They're so desperate for their users to get premium membership that they even made lyrics which is bare minimum of an app used to listen to music a premium feature, are we serious? Spotify keeps getting worst with each new update and I think I'll switch apps now\"},{\"review_id\":\"c0bd07d3-9ec7-42cb-8811-f8ede24a6bb7\",\"review_text\":\"It's getting worser and worser after every update.. Done with it\"}]}"
